### Versioned endpoint: get all tickets
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/tickets
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Create a new ticket
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/tickets
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Laptop not working",
  "description": "My laptop is not turning on.",
  "category": "Hardware",
  "priority": "MEDIUM",
  "createdBy": "justin@example.com"
}

### Versioned endpoint: paged tickets
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/tickets/paged?page=0&size=5&sortBy=createdAt&direction=desc
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### API quality: invalid page should return 400 Bad Request
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/tickets/paged?page=-1&size=5&sortBy=createdAt&direction=desc
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### API quality: invalid size should return 400 Bad Request
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/tickets/paged?page=0&size=100&sortBy=createdAt&direction=desc
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### API quality: invalid sort field should return 400 Bad Request
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/tickets/paged?page=0&size=5&sortBy=password&direction=desc
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Filter tickets by status
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/tickets?status=CLOSED
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Filter tickets by priority
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/tickets?priority=LOW
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Filter tickets by category
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/tickets?category=Hardware
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Sort by createdAt, newest first
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/tickets/paged?page=0&size=5&sortBy=createdAt&direction=desc
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Sort by createdAt, oldest first 
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/tickets/paged?page=0&size=5&sortBy=createdAt&direction=asc
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Sort by priority ascending
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/tickets/paged?page=0&size=5&sortBy=priority&direction=asc
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Report: tickets grouped by status
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/reports/tickets-by-status
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Report: tickets grouped by priority
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/reports/tickets-by-priority
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}